  "description": "Discovery I is the most affordable\n\nof the three Discovery series bikes. Both its frame and stays are steel. Its\n\nrear shock, a Tough Shock SD, has preload adjustment. Its fork is an RST Mozo,\n\nsame as the Discovery II, with 63mm of travel.\n\nThe shifting and braking components are Shimano, the pedals Wellgo, the hubs\n\noversized Fuji alloy in black. The rims, like those of the other Discoveries,\n\nare Alex aluminum. The linear pull brakes are the same across the series. All the Discovery bikes are remarkable values. Discovery\n\nI is the most affordable, fully-active dual-suspension bike that meets Fuji's\n\ndemanding standards. Ride one. Prepare for a surprise.",
